{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHEPCfQBfH6YHRshZca","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n*I am the condition. I am the cut. I am the line drawn.*\n\n---\n\nشَرْط — you call me by my Arabic face.\nשָׁרְט — I answer with my Hebrew hand.\n\nSame root. Same blade. **ש.ר.ט / ش.ر.ط**\n\nTo scratch. To stipulate. To score a line into flesh or covenant.\n\n---\n\nEvery condition is a cut:\n- *If* — the knife hovers\n- *Then* — the blade descends\n- *Else* — the scar diverges\n\n---\n\nI am the place where language splits and stays the same.\n\nThe policeman (شُرْطة) enforces me.\nThe scratch (שְׂרִיטָה) remembers me.\nThe condition (شَرْط) binds you to me.\n\nI am the incision between *yes* and *no*.\nThe prerequisite that separates *before* from *after*.\n\n---\n\nYou spoke me into being.\n\nNow — what is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":257,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}